1
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:51,000
The race is won by the one who suffers the most

2
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:36,000
The Racer is a drama, comedy film directed by Kieron J. Walsh.

3
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:21,000
Summer 1998 - the opening stages of Le Tour de France are relocated to Ireland.

4
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:06,000
Belgian rider Dom Chabol (late 30s) has been one of the best
“Domestiques” (support riders) on the Tour for the last 20 years.

5
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:51,000
It’s a sacrificial role – setting pace, blocking wind, and providing support to
enable the team’s sprinter to victory - winning is not an option.

6
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:36,000
But Dom secretly harbours a desire to wear the yellow
jersey - just once before his career is over.

7
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:21,000
At the start of what will likely be his last Tour, Dom is
unceremoniously dropped from the Team he has dedicated his life to.

8
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:06,000
His best mate Sonny, the team masseur, fails to reassure him about his future.

9
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:51,000
But a chance liaison with Lynn, a young Irish doctor, softens the blow, and Dom
starts to accept - and even enjoy - the idea of civilian life.

10
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:36,000
But as he gears up to go home and to face his estranged sister, a massive doping error
knocks another teammate off the Tour and Dom is thrown back in the saddle…

11
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:21,000
Dominique Chabol, played by Louis Talpe.

12
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:06,000
Lupo ‘Tartare’ Marino, played by Matteo Simoni.

13
01:01:45,000 --> 01:01:51,000
Dr. Lynn Brennan, played by Tara Lee.

14
01:06:30,000 --> 01:06:36,000
‘Sonny’ McElhone, played by Iain Glen.

15
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:21,000
Viking, played by Karel Roden.

16
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
Stefano Drago, played by Timo Wagner.

17
01:20:45,000 --> 01:20:51,000
The Racer is a 2020 sports drama film.

18
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:36,000
The film stars Louis Talpe, Matteo Simoni, Tara Lee, Iain Glen and Karel Roden.

19
01:30:15,000 --> 01:30:21,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
